  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anti-Fraud and Corruption Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a follow up of the Shiraka Training Public Finance Management in 2019, approximately 30 employees of the Controle General de Finances (CGF) of the Ministry of Finance of Tunisia will receive a tailormade, highly interactive two days training which is awarded by the European Commission as a Good Practice in Combating Fraud and Corruption in the EU.The participants gain basic knowledge on anti-fraud and corruption theory and will practice with tools to combat fraud and corruption during realistic and practical casework.This supports them to combat issues related to fraud, corruption and lack of good governance in public finances management at a governmental level in Tunisia.</narrative>
  </description>
